  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      185.13,
      204.05,
      378.56,
      228.47
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SAMATA SARANA SAHANASEWA FOUNDATION",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      243.05,
      401.9,
      319.43
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the \u201cSamataSarana Sahana Sewa Foundation\u201d has heretofore beenestablished in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out its objects and transacting all matters connectedwith the said foundation according to the rules agreed to bythe members:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      334.13,
      401.9,
      397.43
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the said application.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      412.13,
      401.88,
      436.43
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Samata Sarana SahanaSewa Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2016.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      451.13,
      401.94,
      579.47
    ],
    "text": "2.(1) From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such as and so many persons as now are members of the\u201cSamata Sarana Sahana Sewa Foundation\u201d or shall hereafterbe admitted as mambers of the Corporation herebyconstituted, shall be a body corporate with perpetualsuccession, under the name and style of the \u201cSamata SaranaSahana Sewa Foundation\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cCorporation\u201d) and by that name may sue and be sued withfull power and authority to have and use a common seal andto alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      594.05,
      401.9,
      670.43
    ],
    "text": "(2) The Corporation shall be deemed to be a voluntarysocial service organization within the meaning and for thepurpose of the Voluntary Social Service Organizations(Registration and Supervision) Act, No. 31 of 1980 and theprovisions of that Act be applicable for the management ofthe affairs of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      452.11,
      455.86,
      499.58
    ],
    "text": "Incorporationof SamataSaranaSahana SewaFoundation.",
