  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      202.73,
      397.19,
      225.83
    ],
    "text": "3.(1) The general objectives for which the Corporationis constituted are hereby declared to be\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      237.89,
      397.16,
      272.63
    ],
    "text": "(a)to provide funds (monetary and non monetary) andorganizing awareness programms for less privilegepersons;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      284.69,
      397.16,
      307.67
    ],
    "text": "(b)to provide basic needs for helpless people whichthey want basically;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      319.73,
      397.18,
      354.47
    ],
    "text": "(c)to uplift the living standards of young persons whohave various capabilities through introduce the selfemployment opportunities and advice them.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      366.53,
      397.21,
      424.67
    ],
    "text": "(2) In the implementation of the objectives specified insubsection (1) the Corporation shall ensure that suchimplementation shall be carried out without any distinctionbased on race, religion, language, cast, sex, political opinion,place of birth or any of such grounds.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      436.73,
      397.24,
      494.87
    ],
    "text": "4.The objects of the Corporation shall be carried out insuch manner so as not to create any conflict between hework of the Corporation and any work being carried outsimultaneously by any Ministry or Department of theGovernment or any Provincial Council.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      530.33,
      397.19,
      600.23
    ],
    "text": "5.(1) Subject to the provisions of this Act theManagement and Administration of the affairs of theCorporation shall be carried out by a Board ofDirectors(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cBoard\u201d) consistingof such number of office bearers as may be specified by therules made under Section 7.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      612.29,
      397.2,
      670.43
    ],
    "text": "(2)(a) The Board of Directors of the Foundation that holdsoffice on the day immediately preceding the date ofcommencement of this Act, shall function as the Board ofthe Corporation until the first Board is appointed or electedin the manner provided for by rules made under Section 7.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      403.15,
      205.15,
      447.43,
      243.02
    ],
