  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      202.97,
      401.9,
      238.31
    ],
    "text": "(b) The first Board of the Corporation shall be appointedor elected within one year of the date of commencement ofthis Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      250.97,
      401.88,
      310.31
    ],
    "text": "(3)(a) Every office bearer of the Board including thepatrons and advisors shall be appointed or elcted for a periodof three years and any such office bearer, patron or advisorshall be eligible for re-appointment or re-election after lapseof the said period of three years.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      322.97,
      401.9,
      370.31
    ],
    "text": "(b) In the event of a vacancy occurring due to the death,resignation, incapacity or removal from office of an officebearer, the Board shall having regard to the rules of theCorporation, elect or appoint a person to fill such vacancy.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      382.97,
      401.89,
      418.31
    ],
    "text": "(c) The person elected or appointed under paragraph (b)shall hold office only for the unexpired portion of the termof office of the member whom he succeeds",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      430.97,
      401.87,
      490.31
    ],
    "text": "6.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to do,perform and execute all such acts and matters as necessaryor desirable for the promotion or furtherance of the objects ofthe Corporation or any one of them, including the power:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      502.97,
      401.92,
      574.31
    ],
    "text": "(a)to purchase, acquire, rent, construct, renovate, andotherwise obtain lands or buildings which may bereqiured for the purposes of the corporation anddeal with or dispose of the same as many be deemedexpedient with a view to promote the objects of theCorporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      586.97,
      401.87,
      622.31
    ],
    "text": "(b)to barrow or raise funds with or without securitiesand to receive grants, gifts or donations in cach orgoods:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
